-- greeter: a tiny module, loaded at runtime by examples/imports.lind.
-- Every atom in here is namespaced by the importer's suffix: imported
-- with "_v2", the machine below is (Greet_v2, who, reply) and emits
-- (Hello_v2, who). The reply goes to whatever bag the caller passes
-- as DATA — this module cannot name the real Global (its mention of
-- it would be mangled along with everything else); the caller shapes
-- what happens next (§4 continuations).
(Greet, who, reply) : lob reply (Hello, who)
